                                        "tags": [
                                            "historical"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c48dccfe-19d1-3778-85c9-27e56ff95390",
                                        "entry_id": "5380e0b6-f2cf-33ad-ad7a-e021e90d58f5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The fleshy red pate of a rooster."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3d0aaf83-c24b-375d-a7be-b8c267cfb80d",
                                        "entry_id": "5380e0b6-f2cf-33ad-ad7a-e021e90d58f5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A foolish or conceited person; a dandy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2d59145c-2bdf-420f-81f0-df93683b0e9d",
                                                "sense_id": "3d0aaf83-c24b-375d-a7be-b8c267cfb80d",
                                                "text": "Thanks to my stars, I once can see / A window here from scribbling free! / Here no conceited coxcombs pass, / To scratch their paltry drabs on glass; / Nor party-fool is calling names, / Or dealing crowns to George and James."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dcbaf899-da36-46fa-8b12-bb8a1d1357bb",
                                                "sense_id": "3d0aaf83-c24b-375d-a7be-b8c267cfb80d",
                                                "text": "[F]or tho' I am afraid the Doctor was a little of a Coxcomb, he might be nevertheleſs very much of a Surgeon."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cc174a28-8bb9-4563-bb88-f1425bb787d5",
                                                "sense_id": "3d0aaf83-c24b-375d-a7be-b8c267cfb80d",
                                                "text": "And she nearly started a fight between two young fops in plumed hats and flouncy collars: \"Clay-brained coxcomb!\" \"Mewling milk-livered maggot!\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
